<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" class="h-full bg-slate-50">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hội Nghị Nhà Chung Cư Ecohome Nhơn Bình 2026</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Canvas Confetti -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    <!-- SheetJS for Excel / CSV Parsing -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0fdf4',
                            100: '#dcfce7',
                            500: '#10b981',
                            600: '#059669',
                            700: '#047857',
                            800: '#065f46',
                            900: '#064e3b',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f5f9; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #94a3b8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="h-full flex flex-col text-slate-800 antialiased selection:bg-brand-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Top Navigation Header -->
    <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-900 via-emerald-800 to-teal-950 text-white shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-30">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-white/10 p-2.5 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20">
                        <i class="fa-solid font-bold fa-building-user text-2xl text-emerald-300"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-200 border border-emerald-400/30">Hội Nghị 2026</span>
                            <span id="sync-status-badge" class="text-xs text-teal-200/80"><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up mr-1 animate-pulse"></i>Đang kết nối Cloud Firebase...</span>
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mt-0.5">
                            NHÀ CHUNG CƯ ECOHOME NHƠN BÌNH
                        </h1>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-center justify-between md:justify-end space-x-3">
                    <button onclick="triggerManualConfetti()" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-emerald-100 rounded-lg transition border border-white/15 flex items-center gap-1.5" title="Bắn pháo hoa thử nghiệm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles text-amber-300"></i>
                        <span>Pháo hoa</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="openAdminModal()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-lg font-medium text-sm transition shadow-md hover:shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 border border-emerald-400/40">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i>
                        <span>Quản Lý (Admin)</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-6">

        <!-- Quorum Threshold Banner & Interactive Bar -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Tỷ Lệ Diện Tích Đã Tham Dự Hội Nghị</h2>
                        <span id="status-badge" class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half"></i> Chưa đạt 50%
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
                        Căn cứ theo quy định: Hội nghị nhà chung cư đủ điều kiện tiến hành khi có từ <strong class="text-slate-700">50% diện tích căn hộ</strong> đại diện tham dự.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right flex items-baseline justify-start lg:justify-end gap-2">
                    <span id="metric-percent" class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-600 tracking-tight">0.00%</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">/ 100% tổng diện tích</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Progress Bar Container -->
            <div class="relative pt-6 pb-2">
                <!-- 50% Marker Label -->
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-[50%] -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center z-10">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-flag"></i> MỐC PHÁP LÝ 50%
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="w-full bg-slate-100 h-7 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-1 border border-slate-200 shadow-inner relative">
                    <!-- Progress Fill -->
                    <div id="progress-bar-fill" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 via-emerald-500 to-green-400 rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out relative" style="width: 0%;">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 animate-pulse"></div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 50% Vertical Line Marker -->
                    <div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-[50%] w-0.5 bg-rose-500 z-0"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mt-2 px-1">
                    <span>0%</span>
                    <span class="text-rose-600 font-bold">50% Quorum</span>
                    <span>100%</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric KPI Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            
            <!-- Card 1: Total Area -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 mb-3">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Tổng Diện Tích Dự Án</span>
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-ruler-combined"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                    <span id="metric-total-area" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800">27.734,30</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">m²</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Dựa trên diện tích sở hữu Ecohome</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2: Attended Area -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 mb-3">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Diện Tích Đã Tham Dự</span>
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-square-check"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                    <span id="metric-attended-area" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600">0,00</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">m²</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-xs">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Còn thiếu:</span>
                    <span id="metric-missing-area" class="font-bold text-slate-600">27.734,30 m²</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3: Total Apartments -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 mb-3">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Tổng Số Căn Hộ</span>
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-door-closed"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                    <span id="metric-total-units" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800">0</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">căn</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Đã nạp vào hệ thống</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 4: Attended Apartments -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 mb-3">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Căn Hộ Đã Đăng Ký</span>
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users-between-lines"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                    <span id="metric-attended-units" class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-600">0</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">căn</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-xs">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Tỷ lệ số căn:</span>
                    <span id="metric-units-percent" class="font-bold text-slate-700">0.0%</span>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Apartment List & Search Section -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">Danh Sách Căn Hộ & Chi Tiết Diện Tích</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Tra cứu mã căn hộ để kiểm tra trạng thái tham dự hội nghị</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Filters & Search Bar -->
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-2">
                    <div class="relative w-full sm:w-64">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 text-xs"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="search-input" oninput="renderTable()" placeholder="Tìm theo Mã căn (Ví dụ: A1-02)..." 
                            class="w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-1.5 text-xs bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 focus:border-emerald-500 transition">
                    </div>

                    <select id="filter-status" onchange="renderTable()" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-xs py-1.5 px-3 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 focus:border-emerald-500 transition font-medium text-slate-600">
                        <option value="all">Tất cả trạng thái</option>
                        <option value="attended">Đã tham dự</option>
                        <option value="absent">Chưa tham dự</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Table Container -->
            <div class="overflow-x-auto max-h-[480px] custom-scrollbar">
                <table class="w-full text-left text-xs text-slate-600">
                    <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-slate-200">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">STT</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">Mã Căn Hộ</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">Tầng / Tòa</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Diện Tích (m²)</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Tỷ Lệ Đóng Góp (%)</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">Trạng Thái Tham Dự</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="apartment-table-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                        <!-- Dynamic Rows loaded via JS -->
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- Table Footer Pagination Info -->
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50/80 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span id="table-count-info">Hiển thị 0 căn hộ</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400">Ecohome Nhơn Bình 2026 • Hệ thống biểu quyết & điểm danh tự động</span>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 text-xs py-6 mt-12 border-t border-slate-800">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center space-y-2">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate-300">Ban Quản Tị / Ban Tổ Chức Hội Nghị Nhà Chung Cư Ecohome Nhơn Bình 2026</p>
            <p class="text-slate-500">Mã hóa mật khẩu hệ thống quản trị an toàn • Mốc tổng diện tích tính toán mặc định: 27.734,30 m²</p>
        </div>
    </footer>


    <!-- MODAL: ADMIN MANAGEMENT PANEL -->
    <div id="admin-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 w-full max-w-3xl overflow-hidden transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 flex flex-col max-h-[90vh]">
            
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 to-teal-950 text-white px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-emerald-400"></i>
                    <h3 id="admin-modal-title" class="font-bold text-base">Hệ Thống Quản Trị Admin</h3>
                </div>
                <button onclick="closeAdminModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition w-8 h-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Modal Body (Dynamic depending on auth state) -->
            <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar flex-1 space-y-6">

                <!-- STATE 1: AUTHENTICATION FORM -->
                <div id="admin-auth-view" class="max-w-md mx-auto py-8 text-center space-y-4">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-inner">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">Yêu Cầu Mật Khẩu Admin</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Vui lòng nhập mật khẩu quản trị viên để mở khóa các tính năng nạp dữ liệu và cấu hình hệ thống.</p>
                    </div>

                    <form onsubmit="handleAdminLogin(event)" class="space-y-3 pt-2">
                        <div class="relative">
                            <input type="password" id="admin-pass-input" placeholder="Nhập mật khẩu (215151365)..." required
                                class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:bg-white outline-none transition">
                        </div>
                        <div id="auth-error-msg" class="text-xs text-rose-600 font-semibold hidden flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation"></i> Mật khẩu không chính xác!
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full py-2.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl text-sm transition shadow-md">
                            Xác Nhận Đăng Nhập
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>

                <!-- STATE 2: ADMIN PANEL DASHBOARD -->
                <div id="admin-panel-view" class="hidden space-y-6">
                    
                    <!-- Admin Tabs Navigation -->
                    <div class="flex border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 gap-2 overflow-x-auto">
                        <button onclick="switchAdminTab('import')" id="tab-btn-import" class="py-2.5 px-4 border-b-2 border-emerald-600 text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i> Nạp Dữ Liệu (Excel/Paste)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchAdminTab('quick-check')" id="tab-btn-quick-check" class="py-2.5 px-4 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-500"></i> Điểm Danh Hàng Loạt
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchAdminTab('manage')" id="tab-btn-manage" class="py-2.5 px-4 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Quản Lý Căn Hộ
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchAdminTab('settings')" id="tab-btn-settings" class="py-2.5 px-4 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-gear"></i> Cấu Hình Gốc
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- TAB 1: UPLOAD & IMPORT DATA -->
                    <div id="tab-content-import" class="space-y-5">
                        
                        <!-- Option A: Upload Excel/CSV File -->
                        <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center bg-slate-50 hover:bg-emerald-50/30 transition cursor-pointer relative group"
                             onclick="document.getElementById('excel-file-input').click()">
                            <input type="file" id="excel-file-input" accept=".xlsx, .xls, .csv" class="hidden" onchange="handleFileUpload(event)">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-excel"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">Tải Lên File Excel (.xlsx, .csv)</h5>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-sm mx-auto">
                                Tự động quét các cột: <strong class="text-slate-700">Mã Căn Hộ</strong> và <strong class="text-slate-700">Diện Tích</strong> trong bảng tính của bạn.
                            </p>
                            <span class="inline-block mt-3 px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold shadow-sm">
                                Chọn tệp từ máy tính
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="relative flex py-1 items-center">
                            <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-200"></div>
                            <span class="flex-shrink mx-4 text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase">Hoặc Dán Trực Tiếp Văn Bản</span>
                            <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-200"></div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Option B: Paste Textarea -->
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
                                Dán danh sách Mã căn & Diện tích (Định dạng: MãCăn, DiệnTích):
                            </label>
                            <textarea id="paste-import-input" rows="5" placeholder="Ví dụ copy từ Excel:&#10;A1-01, 68.5&#10;A1-02, 72.3&#10;A1-03, 55.0"
                                class="w-full p-3 text-xs font-mono bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:bg-white outline-none"></textarea>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Chấp nhận ngăn cách bởi Dấu phẩy (,), Tab, hoặc Dấu gạch đứng (|)</span>
                                <button onclick="handlePasteImport()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg text-xs shadow transition">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-plus mr-1"></i> Nạp Danh Sách
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- TAB 2: QUICK BATCH ATTENDANCE -->
                    <div id="tab-content-quick-check" class="hidden space-y-4">
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs text-amber-800 space-y-1">
                            <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-900">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600"></i> Điểm danh hàng loạt siêu tốc
                            </div>
                            <p>Nhập hoặc Dán danh sách các <strong>Mã Căn Hộ</strong> đã đăng ký có mặt tại hội nghị. Hệ thống sẽ tự động tìm và đổi trạng thái sang <strong>"Đã Tham Dự"</strong>.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Mã căn hộ tham dự (Phân cách bằng phẩy, khoảng trắng hoặc xuống dòng):</label>
                            <textarea id="quick-check-input" rows="6" placeholder="A1-01, A1-02, A1-05, A2-10, B1-04..."
                                class="w-full p-3 text-xs font-mono bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:bg-white outline-none"></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex justify-end gap-2">
                            <button onclick="executeQuickAttendance(true)" class="px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg text-xs shadow transition">
